  "text": "PLATFORM CONTROL\nPlatform Owner\nPLATFORM CONTROL CENTER\nExecutive Dashboard\nBUSINESS MANAGEMENT\nRestaurants\nRestaurant Owners\nBranches\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Billing\nSAAS MANAGEMENT\nPlans & Entitlements\nFeature Catalog\nQR Ordering Suite\nWhatsApp Ordering\nJAMAN AI Engine\nMaster Menu Catalog\nActivation Keys\nPayment Gateways\nPlatform Payments\nRestaurant Payouts\nApplications & Releases\nOPERATIONS & MDM\nDevice Fleet / MDM\nSync & Conflict Monitor\nBackups & Recovery\nSystem Telemetry\nStaging Sandboxes\nSECURITY & REPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nAudit Logs\nEmergency Offline Policy\nPlatform Team\nSupport Tickets\nDiagnostics & Support\nPlatform Settings\nACCOUNT\nMy Profile\nPlatform Online\nJAMANVAAR Cloud v1.4.0\nJAMANVAAR PLATFORM\nControl Center\nCtrl+K\nPLATFORM ONLINE\nJ\nJAMANVAAR Super Admin\nPlatform Owner\nLogout\nQR Ordering Suite Control\nSAAS FLEET\n\nPlatform control for QR table ordering entitlements, quotas and fleet health. Usage figures are reported by each restaurant's POS; the platform never estimates them.\n\nRefresh fleet\nRESTAURANTS\n2\n2 active · 0 disabled or unentitled\nREPORTING USAGE\n2\n0 have never reported QR usage\nACTIVE QR TABLES\n0\n2 of 2 restaurants reporting\nQR ORDERS TODAY\n0\n2 of 2 restaurants reporting\nQR REVENUE TODAY\n₹0\n2 of 2 restaurants reporting\nAPPROACHING QUOTA\n0\nCandidates for a table quota or plan upgrade\nReading this page: a — means the restaurant has not reported that measurement yet, not that it is zero. Active tables, orders, revenue and last activity appear once the restaurant's POS reports QR usage to the platform. Entitlements and quotas below are platform configuration and are always accurate.\nAll\n2\nActive\n2\nDisabled\n0\nLimit reached\n0\nNot entitled\n0\nAll plan tiers\nPRO\nAny usage state\nReporting usage\nNo usage reported\n2 of 2 restaurants\nRESTAURANT & BRANCH\tPLAN\tENTITLEMENT\tACTIVE TABLES\tREPORTED TODAY\tSTATUS\tLAST ACTIVITY\tACTIONS\n\nQ\nQA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734\nQA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734 — Main Branch\n+2\n·\nAhmedabad\n\t\nKIOSK PRO\nPRO\n\t\nENTITLED\nService on\n\t\n0 / 0\n\t\n0 orders\n₹0\nReported Just now\n\t\nACTIVE\t\n—\nNo activity reported\n\t\nView\nManage\n\n\nQ\nQA-Restaurant-B-1791252294734\nQA-Restaurant-B-1791252294734 — Main Branch\n+1\n·\nAhmedabad\n\t\nJAMANVAAR PRO\nPRO\n\t\nENTITLED\nService on\n\t\n0 / 0\n\t\n0 orders\n₹0\nReported Just now\n\t\nACTIVE\t\n—\nNo activity reported\n\t\nView\nManage\nKELVIONTECH ENTERPRISE\nCloud Control Active\nENTERPRISE MULTI-TENANT CLOUD CONTROL\nv2.0 • POWERED BY KELVIONTECH\n\nJAMANVAAR CLOUD PLATFORM CONTROL\n\nSUPER ADMIN\nCore Engine Ready\n•\nCloud Database Connected\n•\nMulti-Tenant Active",
